  "experimental_role": "Settled opt-in decode working profile for two V100 PCIe 32 GB GPUs, dual Xeon Gold 6240 and 181 GiB RAM. Grouped resident FP4 products and ordered scatter measured 41.24 decode / 519.34 prefill tok/s versus 39.85 / 519.94 in the same-build control: three full warmups and three timed 8192-input/512-output requests per side, all six streams identical, zero timed major faults or swap. Both sides separately passed eight reused long and eight reused natural-length coding cases. The original absolute speed-selection gate failed and is retained as failed; this profile freezes the working configuration after decode tuning stopped. Fresh20 remain unscored. Original 5.26 reference, qualified KDA preset and installer defaults are unchanged. See docs/GLM_DFLASH2_V100.md."
